msgstr "高级选项卡"

#: guided.py:372
msgid "Aim"
msgstr "目标"

#: guided.py:287
msgid "Aim for a number of faces instead of a look; the result then says how much the look changed"
msgstr "以目标面数而非外观为准；结果会说明外观变化程度"

#: guided.py:286
msgid "Aim for a share of your faces instead of a look; the result then says how much the look changed"
msgstr "以目标面数占比而非外观为准；结果会说明外观变化程度"

#: segments.py:860
msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

#: ui.py:617
msgid "All Measurements"
msgstr "所有测量"

#: segment_goals.py:54
msgid "All quads of an even size that follow the surface, ready for a Subdivision modifier"
msgstr "全部为尺寸均匀、贴合表面的四边面，可直接用于细分曲面修改器"

#: profiles.py:23
msgid "All quads where the shape allows it (extra faces are added to close the rest)"
msgstr "在形状允许处全部使用四边面（其余部分会添加额外面来封闭）"

#: operators.py:68
msgid "Allow rebuilding of dirty closed scans. Small holes and thin sheets may change"
msgstr "允许重建不干净的封闭扫描。小孔和薄片可能会改变"

#: operators.py:53
msgid "Allow voxel repair before remeshing a leaky or noisy scan"
msgstr "允许在重网格化有泄漏或噪声的扫描前进行体素修复"

#: operators.py:176
#: ui.py:54
msgid "Also line up with the main bending directions of the surface"
msgstr "同时对齐表面的主要弯曲方向"

#: guided.py:292
msgid "Also redraws messy patches as grids and evens out the quads. Tidiest; adds a few minutes"
msgstr "还会将杂乱面片重绘为网格并均匀四边面。最整洁；会多花几分钟"

#: region.py:561
msgid "Always"
msgstr "始终"

