#: panel.py:1036
msgid "Classic Guided"
msgstr "经典引导"

#: guided.py:451
msgid "Classic Guided, Whole Mesh: makes every face a quad. Off is faster on big meshes and leaves a few triangles"
msgstr "经典引导，整个网格：使每个面都成为四边面。关闭时在大网格上更快，但会留下少量三角面"

#: guided.py:427
msgid "Classic Guided: draws each point's reach and the outline of the area it covers"
msgstr "经典引导：绘制每个点的作用范围及其覆盖区域的外轮廓"

#: guided.py:450
msgid "Classic Guided: edges sharper than this angle count as hard edges and are kept"
msgstr "经典引导：角度大于此值的边视为硬边并保留"

#: guided.py:446
msgid "Classic Guided: how many passes settle the new quads onto your surface. More follows it closer, slower"
msgstr "经典引导：新四边面贴合表面的迭代次数。数值越大贴合越紧，速度越慢"

#: guided.py:452
msgid "Classic Guided: how many points Auto-suggest places"
msgstr "经典引导：自动建议放置多少个点"

#: guided.py:350
msgid "Classic Guided: shows the point cage and keeps a live preview of the new quads beside your mesh"
msgstr "经典引导：显示点笼，并在网格旁实时预览新四边面"

#: guided.py:351
msgid "Classic Guided: the starting quad size, point type and fill style for this kind of mesh"
msgstr "经典引导：此类网格的初始四边面大小、点类型和填充样式"

