msgid "How UVs and textures are carried over to the new mesh"
msgstr "UV 和纹理如何转移到新网格上"

#: guided.py:448
msgid "How big quads inside flat areas may get. Left makes them smaller and more even; right fewer and longer. Reruns the search"
msgstr "平坦区域内四边形可以多大。向左更小更均匀；向右更少更长。会重新运行搜索"

#: guided.py:367
msgid "How close to your mesh the result must look, as the share of the view that may change. Lower keeps more faces; higher gives a rougher, lighter mesh"
msgstr "结果与网格的接近程度，以可变化的视图占比表示。越低保留越多面；越高网格越粗糙、越轻"

#: guided.py:364
msgid "How close to your mesh the result stays. More detail keeps more faces"
msgstr "结果与网格的接近程度。细节越多保留的面越多"

#: guided.py:370
msgid "How each part's faces are made. Auto suits nearly every mesh; you can give each part its own method after the search"
msgstr "各部件面的生成方式。自动适合几乎所有网格；搜索后可给每个部件单独指定方法"

#: operators.py:175
#: ui.py:53
msgid "How far a surface may bump away from flat and still become one big quad, as a percent of the mesh size. Higher gives fewer faces and less detail"
msgstr "表面偏离平面后仍能成为一个大四边面的程度，以网格尺寸的百分比计。越高面越少、细节越少"

#: region.py:807
msgid "How far each point moves toward its smoothed spot on every pass: 0 not at all, 1 all the way"
msgstr "每轮中每个点向平滑位置移动的程度：0 为不移动，1 为完全移动"

#: guided.py:181
msgid "How far the point reaches (object-space units)"
msgstr "点的影响范围（物体空间单位）"

#: guided.py:2684
msgid "How far the point reaches, in scene units. 0 picks a size from the mesh type"
msgstr "点的影响范围，以场景单位计。0 表示根据网格类型自动选择大小"

#: operators.py:193
#: ui.py:71
msgid "How hard to tidy leftover triangles, n-gons and bad corners (0 = off, 1 = strongest)"
msgstr "整理残留三角面、N 边形和不良角的强度（0 = 关闭，1 = 最强）"

#: guided.py:368
msgid "How hard to work this computer. Light keeps Blender smooth while it works; Full finishes soonest; Auto picks from your cores and free memory"
msgstr "电脑的工作强度。轻量可让 Blender 在工作时保持流畅；完整最快完成；自动根据核心数和可用内存选择"

#: guided.py:361
msgid "How many Multires levels to add. Each level has four times the faces of the one below it"
msgstr "要添加的多级精度级别数。每一级的面数是其下一级的四倍"

#: operators.py:178
#: ui.py:56
msgid "How many candidate results are built and compared; the best one wins. More is slower"
msgstr "构建并比较多少个候选结果；最佳者胜出。更多会更慢"

#: operators.py:181
#: ui.py:59
msgid "How many faces are sampled when scanning very large meshes. More is slower and more exact"
msgstr "扫描超大网格时采样多少个面。更多会更慢也更精确"

#: guided.py:382
msgid "How many faces the selected parts get when you press Redo. The middle keeps the quad size they have now"
msgstr "按下重做时，所选部分得到的面数。中间值保持当前的四边面大小"

#: guided.py:374
msgid "How many faces to end up with, as a share of your mesh's faces now. 25% turns 40,000 faces into about 10,000"
msgstr "最终面数，占当前网格面数的比例。25% 会把 40,000 面变成约 10,000 面"

#: guided.py:375
msgid "How many faces to end up with. The result lands within about 10% of it unless the parts can't go that low"
msgstr "最终面数。结果会落在大约 10% 误差内，除非各部分无法降到那么低"

#: guided.py:396
msgid "How many parallel loops each drawn line makes: the line itself plus one more on each side is 3"
msgstr "每条绘制的线生成多少条平行循环边：线本身加两侧各一条为 3"

#: guided.py:398
msgid "How many parallel loops each joint line makes. 3 is the least that bends well; use more across a big joint"
msgstr "每条关节线生成多少条平行循环边。3 是能良好弯曲的最小值；大关节处可使用更多"

#: seglive.py:66
msgid "How many parts the mesh is cut into. Left finds only the big parts, right also the small ones; locked parts stay"
msgstr "网格会被切成多少部分。左侧只找大部件，右侧也会找小部件；锁定的部分保持不变"

#: guided.py:428
msgid "How many sides each cylinder and ball has (small parts get half). More sides look rounder and cost faces"
msgstr "每个圆柱和球体有多少条边（小部件减半）。边越多越圆，但更耗面"

#: operators.py:171
#: ui.py:49
msgid "How many starting points PairClosure tries. More is slower and usually cleaner"
msgstr "PairClosure 尝试多少个起始点。更多会更慢，但通常更干净"

#: region.py:806
msgid "How many times the points are smoothed and settled back on the surface. More follows it closer, slower"
msgstr "点被平滑并重新贴合到表面的次数。更多会更贴合表面，但更慢"

#: guided.py:413
msgid "How much more of the look Tidy Up may change, in percent, on top of the result as it was"
msgstr "在原有结果之上，整理最多可额外改变外观的百分比"

#: seglive.py:70
msgid "How much part borders are rounded off where no crease holds them. Right: smoother, rounder borders"
msgstr "在没有折痕约束处，部件边界的圆滑程度。右侧：更平滑、更圆的边界"

#: seglive.py:69
msgid "How much sharp edges split the mesh into parts. More: every crease becomes a part border"
msgstr "锐边将网格分割成部件的程度。更多：每条折痕都会成为部件边界"

#: guided.py:365
msgid "How much tidying runs after the search. More is tidier and takes longer"
msgstr "搜索后执行多少整理。更多更整洁，但耗时更长"

#: guided.py:447
msgid "How readily round, smooth areas become rows of quads that follow their curve. Right finds more of them and adds faces. Reruns the search"
msgstr "圆形平滑区域有多容易变成沿其曲率排列的四边面行。右侧会找到更多并增加面。会重新运行搜索"

#: __init__.py:142
msgid "How solid the dashboard background is. Text always stays fully opaque"
msgstr "仪表板背景的实心程度。文本始终保持完全不透明"

#: guided.py:405
msgid "How strongly the marks move faces. 1 keeps about four times as many faces under More Detail as under Less Detail"
msgstr "标记移动面的强度。1 时，“更多细节”下的面数约为“更少细节”下的四倍"

#: guided.py:182
msgid "How strongly the point changes the quad size: 1 = about three times smaller (or bigger for Calm) at the centre"
msgstr "点改变四边面大小的强度：1 = 中心处约缩小到三分之一（Calm 时则放大到三倍）"

#: operators.py:168
#: ui.py:46
msgid "How the new quads are built. Smart (Atlas-Q) measures the mesh, then tries several solvers and keeps the best"
msgstr "新四边面的构建方式。智能（Atlas-Q）会测量网格，然后尝试多种求解器并保留最佳结果"

#: region.py:567
msgid "How the part to redo is chosen"
