msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Put the closest remembered fix in. A camera looks at the spot from six sides first and the fix is dropped if it makes the spot look further from your original"
msgstr "应用最接近的已记住修复。摄像机会先从六个方向查看该位置；如果修复让该位置看起来更偏离你的原始结果，则放弃该修复"

#: segment_goals.py:1092
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Puts the parts back as they were before the last merge, split, grow, shrink or paint (Ctrl+Z while reviewing)"
msgstr "将部件恢复到上次合并、拆分、扩展、收缩或绘制之前的状态（查看时按 Ctrl+Z）"

#: segments.py:563
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Puts your own faces back on every part with bad faces. Each part can be switched back from its card"
msgstr "在所有存在不良面的部件上恢复你自己的面。每个部件都可以从其卡片切换回来"

#: issue_panel.py:206
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Puts your own faces back on the part under this spot. It asks first; Put Reduced Back undoes it"
msgstr "恢复此位置下部件上你自己的面。会先询问；“放回缩减结果”可撤销"

#: ladder.py:555
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Quad Size of Selected"
msgstr "选中项的四边形大小"

#: operators.py:232
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Quality Preset"
msgstr "质量预设"

#: guided.py:3290
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Read your cores and memory, time a short test, and count the loose pieces of the selected mesh, so the panel can say how big this job is for this PC"
msgstr "读取你的核心数和内存，运行一次短测试并计时，统计选中网格的松散块数量，以便面板说明这项任务对这台电脑来说有多大"

#: guided.py:2896
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rebuild only the faces selected on the preview (a strip or loop of faces) with the region tool. The rest of the preview is frozen afterwards"
msgstr "使用区域工具仅重建预览中选中的面（一条面带或面循环）。之后预览的其余部分会被冻结"

#: guided.py:2789
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rebuild the preview now, even when it is too big for automatic updates. Whole Mesh and Points Only run in one go: Blender is busy until they are done"
msgstr "立即重建预览，即使它太大而无法自动更新。“整个网格”和“仅点”会一次运行：在它们完成之前 Blender 会一直忙碌"

#: panel.py:690
#: segment_goals.py:1400
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Redo"
msgstr "重做"

#: issue_panel.py:175
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Redo This Spot"
msgstr "重做此位置"

#: panel.py:276
#: panel.py:655
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Redo this spot"
msgstr "重做此位置"

#: guided.py:2895
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Redraw Strip"
msgstr "重绘条带"

#: region.py:1063
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Refresh Preview"
msgstr "刷新预览"

#: region.py:800
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Relax vertices along the surface and snap them back onto it; open borders (and unselected vertices in Edit Mode) stay put"
msgstr "沿表面松弛顶点并将其吸附回表面；开放边界（以及编辑模式中未选中的顶点）保持不动"

#: issue_panel.py:176
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remakes the part under this spot with smaller quads, which usually clears folded or crossing faces. The old version stays in the part's tries"
msgstr "用更小的四边形重建此位置下的部件，通常可清除折叠或交叉的面。旧版本会保留在该部件的尝试记录中"

#: segment_goals.py:1401
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remakes the selected parts for this Use; only they change and their borders stay. Every result stays in the part's tries"
msgstr "为此用途重建选中的部件；只有它们会改变，其边界保持不变。每个结果都会保留在该部件的尝试记录中"

#: segments.py:883
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remakes the selected parts with this method; the rest stays. Every result stays in the part's tries"
msgstr "用此方法重做所选部分；其余保持不变。每个结果都保留在该部分的尝试记录中"

#: panel.py:990
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remember"
msgstr "记住"

#: guided.py:1324
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remember This Fix"
msgstr "记住此修复"

#: guided.py:1325
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remember the area you fixed by hand on the preview, and offer the same fix where the pattern shows up again. Kept on this mesh (custom property curiomesh_kept, saved in the .blend) and in the add-on's user folder; nothing is uploaded"
msgstr "记住你在预览中手动修复的区域，并在相同模式再次出现时提供相同的修复。保存在此网格上（自定义属性 curiomesh_kept，存于 .blend）以及插件的用户文件夹中；不会上传任何内容"

#: batch.py:142
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remesh every selected mesh with the current settings and save one JSON report. Each mesh is remeshed in one go, so Blender is busy while it runs; Esc stops between meshes"
msgstr "用当前设置重网格化所有选中的网格，并保存一份 JSON 报告。每个网格一次性完成，因此运行期间 Blender 会忙碌；按 Esc 可在网格之间停止"

#: operators.py:163
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remesh to Quads"
msgstr "重网格化为四边面"

#: guided.py:3523
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove Guide"
msgstr "移除引导"

#: guided.py:2713
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove Point"
msgstr "移除点"

#: guided.py:3481
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove Shape"
msgstr "移除形状"

#: region.py:771
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove Volume"
msgstr "移除体积"

#: guided.py:2727
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove every point from the mesh (tagged empties stay)"
msgstr "移除网格中的所有点（带标记的空物体保留）"

#: region.py:772
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove the highlighted volume from the list (the object stays)"
msgstr "从列表中移除高亮的体积（物体保留）"

#: guided.py:2714
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove the point selected in the list"
msgstr "移除列表中选中的点"

#: guided.py:3240
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove the preview and keep your mesh as it was. Your points and guides stay"
msgstr "移除预览并保持网格原样。你的点和引导会保留"

#: segment_goals.py:1502
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rename"
msgstr "重命名"

#: segment_goals.py:1120
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rename Part"
msgstr "重命名部分"

#: issue_panel.py:324
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Report a Problem (opens browser)"
msgstr "报告问题（打开浏览器）"

#: __init__.py:273
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Reset CurioMesh Preferences"
msgstr "重置 CurioMesh 偏好设置"

#: segment_goals.py:1608
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Review Parts"
msgstr "检查部分"

#: panel.py:716
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Review parts in the viewport"
msgstr "在视图中检查部分"

#: flowedit.py:645
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Ring"
msgstr "环"

#: issue_panel.py:281
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Save Issue Report"
msgstr "保存问题报告"

#: guided.py:1413
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Save a copy of your remembered fixes to share. They hold quad patterns and shape numbers only, no mesh"
msgstr "保存一份记住的修复副本以便分享。其中只包含四边面模式和形状编号，不含网格"

#: issue_panel.py:282
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Saves the list of bad spots to a file you pick, so a later run can be compared with it"
msgstr "将问题点列表保存到你选择的文件，以便后续运行与之比较"

#: issue_panel.py:121
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Select"
msgstr "选择"

#: guided.py:2814
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Select Faces on Preview"
msgstr "在预览中选择面"

#: segments.py:856
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Select Parts"
msgstr "选择部分"

#: guided.py:3658
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Select the chosen curve and open it in Edit Mode: move its points, or press G to move all of it. The preview follows. Tab back to the mesh when done"
msgstr "选中选定的曲线并进入编辑模式：移动其点，或按 G 移动整条曲线。预览会跟随。完成后按 Tab 返回网格"

#: issue_panel.py:122
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Select the faces of this problem spot in Edit Mode"
msgstr "在编辑模式下选择此问题点的面"

#: panel.py:965
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Selected"
msgstr "已选中"

#: segments.py:857
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Selects all the parts, none, the ten that changed most, or every part of one kind"
msgstr "选择所有部分、无、变化最大的十个，或某一类型的每个部分"

#: overlay.py:702
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Show Quality Heatmap"
msgstr "显示质量热力图"

#: panel.py:277
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Show me"
msgstr "显示给我"

#: segment_goals.py:1499
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Shrink"
msgstr "收缩"

#: segment_goals.py:1547
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Smaller Quads"
msgstr "更小的四边面"

#: panel.py:686
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Smaller quads"
msgstr "更小的四边面"

#: panel.py:964
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Sphere"
msgstr "球体"

#: segment_goals.py:1198
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split"
msgstr "拆分"

#: segment_goals.py:1077
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split in Two"
msgstr "一分为二"

#: segment_goals.py:1078
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Splits the selected part in two along its most natural border. Both halves are locked"
msgstr "沿最自然的边界将所选部分一分为二。两半都会被锁定"

#: guided.py:3251
#: panel.py:207
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

#: guided.py:3252
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Start Auto Segments on the selected mesh. A bar shows the progress; Blender stays responsive between short steps and Stop works any time. Starting again throws away the areas you fixed"
msgstr "在所选网格上启动自动分段。进度条显示进度；Blender 在短暂步骤之间保持响应，可随时停止。再次开始会丢弃你修复的区域"

#: panel.py:207
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Start again"
msgstr "重新开始"

#: guided.py:3874
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Start with Auto"
msgstr "以自动开始"

#: guided.py:3406
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: guided.py:3383
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop Working Out Sizes"
msgstr "停止计算尺寸"

#: guided.py:1440
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop putting the fixes you made by hand back on this mesh when you press Start again. Your remembered library is not touched"
msgstr "再次按开始时，不再将你手动做的修复重新应用到此网格。已记住的库不受影响"

#: panel.py:716
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop reviewing (Esc)"
msgstr "停止检查（Esc）"

#: guided.py:3407
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop the work that is running now. Stopping the search throws its partial result away; stopping a redo inside the shapes brings back the result from before it"
msgstr "停止当前正在运行的工作。停止搜索会丢弃其部分结果；停止形状内的重做会恢复到之前的结果"

#: guided.py:3384
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop working out more sizes for the sliders. The sizes already made stay; Start again to work out the rest"
msgstr "停止为滑块计算更多尺寸。已计算的尺寸会保留；重新开始以计算其余部分"

#: segments.py:909
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Switch the selected part back to this result. It is shown at once; the whole-object check follows in short steps while you keep working"
msgstr "将所选部分切换回此结果。会立即显示；整体检查会在你继续工作时分步进行"

#: issue_panel.py:246
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Switches the parts that got your own faces back to the reduced faces they had before Keep Original"
msgstr "将应用了你自己的面的部分切换回保留原始之前的精简面"

#: flowedit.py:629
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Take away every Flow Editor stroke; the result goes back to how it was before you drew"
msgstr "移除所有 Flow Editor 笔触；结果恢复到绘制之前的状态"

#: guided.py:3524
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Take the chosen guide out of the list. A curve drawn with Draw Guide is deleted with it; your own curves stay"
msgstr "从列表中移除选定的引导。用绘制引导绘制的曲线会一并删除；你自己的曲线会保留"

#: guided.py:3482
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Take the chosen shape out of the list. A box or sphere made here is deleted with it; your own meshes stay"
msgstr "从列表中移除选定的形状。在此创建的立方体或球体会一并删除；你自己的网格会保留"

#: segment_goals.py:1144
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "The faces inside the shapes in the list become a new part. Union, Subtract and Intersect combine the shapes"
msgstr "列表中形状内部的面会成为新部分。并集、差集和交集用于组合形状"

#: operators.py:164
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Turn the active mesh into clean quads at the target face count. Runs in one go, like Blender's Remesh: Blender is busy until it is done (about 10-20 seconds on a 20,000-60,000-face mesh). Undo restores the original"
msgstr "将活动网格转为目标面数的干净四边面。像 Blender 的重网格一样一次性运行：完成前 Blender 会忙碌（20,000-60,000 面的网格约需 10-20 秒）。撤销可恢复原始状态"

#: segment_goals.py:1091
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Undo Edit"
msgstr "撤销编辑"

#: guided.py:2878
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Unlock All"
msgstr "全部解锁"

#: guided.py:2788
#: panel.py:1098
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

#: segments.py:908
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Use This Result"
msgstr "使用此结果"

#: guided.py:3502
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Use the selected curves, Grease Pencil drawings or edge-only meshes as guide curves (or as Deformation Lines)"
msgstr "将选中的曲线、蜡笔绘图或仅含边的网格用作引导曲线（或用作变形线）"

#: issue_panel.py:109
#: panel.py:651
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "View"
msgstr "查看"

#: segment_goals.py:1609
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Walks the parts in the viewport: hover to see one, click for its options, arrow keys go worst first. Esc leaves and keeps everything"
msgstr "在视图中逐个查看各个部分：悬停可查看其中一个，点击可查看其选项，方向键从最差的开始。按 Esc 退出并保留全部内容"

#: panel.py:99
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "What Is It For"
msgstr "用途"

#: guided.py:2553
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Work Live"
msgstr "实时工作"

#: guided.py:3394
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Work Out Other Sizes"
msgstr "计算其他尺寸"

#: guided.py:3395
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Work out the other sizes for the Quad Size and Rows sliders in short steps. This can take several minutes; it uses about a third of Blender's time, and single steps last about half a second on a 60,000-face mesh, up to about 1.5 seconds with Field Rows or on bigger meshes. Stop Working Out Sizes ends it at any time"
msgstr "以较小的步长计算“四边形大小”和“行数”滑块的其他尺寸。这可能需要几分钟；它会占用 Blender 约三分之一的时间，在 60,000 面的网格上单步约需半秒，使用 Field Rows 或在更大的网格上则最多约 1.5 秒。“停止计算尺寸”可随时结束"

#: guided.py:3304
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Write a folder with this mesh, your settings and a script, to run the same search on a stronger computer. You copy it there; nothing is uploaded"
msgstr "写出一个包含此网格、你的设置和一个脚本的文件夹，以便在更强的电脑上运行相同的搜索。由你自行复制到那里；不会上传任何内容"

#: guided.py:3138
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Write the preview as <name>_Retopo (or into your object, see Result). Undo restores"
msgstr "将预览写出为 <name>_Retopo（或写入你的物体，见“结果”）。撤销可恢复"

#: region.py:643
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Write the previewed quads into your mesh (or a copy, see Result). Undo restores it"
msgstr "将预览的四边形写入你的网格（或副本，见“结果”）。撤销可恢复"

#: game_export.py:136
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Write the selected meshes and their baked textures for a game engine, with the normal map, scale, texture size and triangle limit that engine needs"
msgstr "将选中的网格及其烘焙纹理导出给游戏引擎，包含该引擎所需的法线贴图、缩放、纹理尺寸和三角面数限制"
